<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB says &quot;buy&quot; Jeronimo Martins.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB says &quot;buy&quot; Jeronimo Martins.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB initiated coverage of Portuguese retailer Jeronimo Martins with a &quot;buy&quot; rating, the investment bank said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>CSFB set a price target of PTE 13,299 and said it expected sustained earnings growth above the sector average.</p>
<p>Shares were trading up 16 at 11,366 by 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
